  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Cut corn cob in half.\n• Transfer corn to a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave corn on high, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Drain any excess liquid, then season with salt and pepper. Top with the softened butter and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8404bcade9b9f0acdf4fe/step-03e79800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Slice haloumi horizontally to make one piece per person.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add sweet chilli sauce and mixed sesame seeds, gently turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8404bcade9b9f0acdf4fe/step-6b4f3510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While haloumi is cooking, halve bake-at-home burger buns and toast or grill to your liking.\n• In a second medium bowl, combine slaw mix, mayonnaise and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8404bcade9b9f0acdf4fe/step-9517cb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build burgers by topping buns with gherkin relish, some creamy slaw and sesame and sweet chilli haloumi.\n• Serve with corn cobs and any remaining slaw. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8404bcade9b9f0acdf4fe/step-9d5c0b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
